# Schedules in America/Sao_Paulo (container TZ). Same cadence the four
# systemd timers had; sunrise/sunset sequences run 40-60 min — supercronic
# has no start timeout, and overlapping trabalho grabs were concurrent under
# systemd too. No catch-up for missed captures (a late sun event is useless);
# the upload's catch-up lives in entrypoint.sh.
0 5 * * * timelapse-capture sunrise
40 16 * * * timelapse-capture sunset
*/15 7-17 * * * timelapse-capture trabalho
0 18 * * * timelapse-capture trabalho
0 20 * * * rclone move /var/lib/timelapse/outbox ceuazul:Timelapse --min-age 1m --log-level INFO
